2026-11-13T10:02:15.7168913Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-13T10:02:15.7169827Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-13T10:02:15.7170260Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-13T10:02:15.7170719Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-13T10:02:15.7171219Z    /root
2026-11-13T10:02:15.7181777Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-13T10:02:15.7185201Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-13T10:02:15.7193344Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-13T10:02:15.7193957Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-13T10:02:15.7194273Z 
